{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Which answers change your price the most, such as page count, a shop or content writing?","Do you sell aftercare or hosting, and should the form ask about it?","Would you rather see a budget range up front, or propose tiers and let the client choose?","What files do you need before you can start, and is it worth asking for them now?"],"howToUseResponses":"Start with the project type and the content answer, because a shop or a client who needs copywriting changes the scope more than the page count does. Use the list of what is wrong with a current site to open your proposal: it shows you listened. If the launch date is close and the content is not ready, say so in the quote and price the risk rather than finding out halfway through.","customizeSteps":["Edit the pages and features lists to match what you build, and remove anything you do not offer.","Add a line to the budget question about how you price, for example fixed packages or day rates.","Embed the form on your pricing or contact page, and export responses to CSV if you track proposals in a spreadsheet."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should a website design quote form include?","a":"The site's main goal, the pages and features needed, who supplies the content, brand assets, examples the client likes and a target launch date. Redesigns also need the current address and what is wrong with it."},{"q":"Should I ask clients for a budget on a web design form?","a":"Yes, but keep it optional. A range helps you suggest the right scope, and clients who are unsure can still send the rest of the brief."},{"q":"Can clients upload their logo and brief through the form?","a":"Yes. Clients who say they already have a brand are asked to upload a logo, brand guide or brief, which saves an email back and forth."},{"q":"Is a quote request the same as agreeing to a project?","a":"No. It gives you enough to prepare a proposal. Scope, price and timings are agreed afterwards through your usual contract."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":10,"title":"Website design quote","description":"Gather the pages, features and content a web design quote depends on.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_websited00","ref":"welcome","title":"Thinking about a new website? Tell us about the project and we'll come back with a proposal.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_websited01","ref":"contact","title":"Who are we putting the quote together for?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"contact_info","fields":["first_name","last_name","email"]},{"id":"blk_websited02","ref":"business","title":"Tell us about your business in a sentence or two.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":600,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_websited03","ref":"project_type","title":"What kind of project is it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_a_brand_new","label":"A brand new website","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_a_redesign_of","label":"A redesign of our current site","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_an_online_shop","label":"An online shop","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_websited04","ref":"current_url","title":"What's the address of your current site?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"url","unique":false,"httpsOnly":false},{"id":"blk_websited05","ref":"whats_wrong","title":"What's not working about it?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_it_looks_dated","label":"It looks dated","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_s_hard","label":"It's hard for us to update","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_it_loads_slowly","label":"It loads slowly","image_key":null},{"